{
  "_comment": "Hook wiring. PreToolUse Write|Edit runs verify_release_gate (denies a banner-bump write without a fresh .release_ready.json sidecar from `python -m dev_harness.harness.check_release_readiness`) then archetype_gate --pre (denies a write that introduces a high or critical archetype finding). PostToolUse Write|Edit runs archetype_gate, which reports the verdict. UserPromptSubmit runs prompt_router. Stop runs session_stop_backstop. The matcher is a REGEX ON THE TOOL NAME, so it also matches MultiEdit and NotebookEdit. Keep it loose on purpose: anything holding Write or Edit reaches the gate, and the gate grades Write, Edit and MultiEdit and refuses every other matching name out loud. Anchoring the matcher would let a future editing tool bypass the gate without ever reaching it. archetype_gate keeps no verdict cache; both sides of every comparison are measured on demand.",
  "_timeouts_comment": "Every hook that shells out to an archetype carries an explicit timeout in SECONDS. Without one, Claude Code's default kills the hook and the gate fails open. Measured 2026-08-10: coding_archetype on src/trading/scrumming_bot.py takes 47-49s, and the gate runs every applicable archetype. archetype_gate caps itself below these numbers (PRE_BUDGET_S, POST_BUDGET_S), so it always returns a verdict before Claude Code can kill it.",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python .claude/hooks/verify_release_gate.py",
            "timeout": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python .claude/hooks/archetype_gate.py --pre",
            "timeout": 300
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python .claude/hooks/archetype_gate.py",
            "timeout": 240
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python .claude/hooks/prompt_router.py",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python .claude/hooks/session_stop_backstop.py",
            "timeout": 120
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "bypassPermissions",
    "allow": [
